  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "• 『機動戦士ガンダム 0080 ポケットの中の戦争』に登場したジム・コマンドのコロニー戦仕様をMG化。",
      "en": "• The colony battle version of the Jim Commando that appeared in \"Mobile Suit Gundam 0080: War in the Pocket\" has been made into an MG."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 特徴的なコロニー仕様のランドセルを新規造形で再現。",
      "en": "• Reproduce the characteristic colony specification school bag with new modeling."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• MG準拠の新規造形でジム・コマンドの特徴的な機体形状を再現。",
      "en": "• Reproduce Jim Command's characteristic aircraft shape with a new MG-compliant model."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 腰部のスムーズな可動や、 腕や脚など人体に近い可動域を実現し、幅広い可動領域で様々なポージングが可能。",
      "en": "• Smooth movement of the waist and a range of motion of the arms and legs similar to that of the human body is achieved, allowing for a wide range of motion and various poses."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ブルパップ・マシンガンなどの武器が付属。",
      "en": "• Weapons such as bullpup and machine gun are included."
    }
